<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fi">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="description" content="<%= metaDescription %>">
    <title><%= documentTitle %></title>

    <meta property="og:type" content="website">
    <meta property="og:url" content="<%= metaUrl %>">
    <meta property="og:title" content="<%= metaTitle %>">
    <meta property="og:description" content="<%= metaDescription %>">
    <meta property="og:site_name" content="Talviliiga">
    <meta property="twitter:card" content="summary">
    <meta property="twitter:title" content="<%= metaTitle %>">
    <meta property="twitter:description" content="<%= metaDescription %>">

    <style>
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; background: #f1f5f9; color: #1e293b; display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-height: 100vh; }
        .container { width: 100%; max-width: 48rem; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1; }

        header { background: #1d4ed8; color: white; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 0 0 0.5rem 0.5rem; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgb(0 0 0 / .1); text-align: center; }
        header h1 { font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; }
        header h1 a { color: white; text-decoration: none; }

        main { padding: 1rem; margin-top: 1rem; flex-grow: 1; }
        @media (min-width: 768px) { main { padding: 2rem; } }

        footer { background: #1e293b; color: #cbd5e1; text-align: center; padding: 1rem; margin-top: 3rem; font-size: 0.875rem; }
        footer p + p { margin-top: 0.5rem; }
        footer a { color: #93c5fd; }

        h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 600; color: #1e40af; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; text-align: center; }
        h2 a { color: #1d4ed8; }
        .subtitle { text-align: center; color: #475569; font-size: 0.875rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }

        /* Team selector */
        .selector-label { display: block; font-size: 1.125rem; font-weight: 500; color: #1e40af; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
        .selector-wrap { position: relative; width: 100%; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
        .selector-input { width: 100%; padding: 0.75rem; padding-right: 2.5rem; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 0.5rem; font-size: 1rem; background: white; cursor: pointer; }
        .selector-input:focus { outline: 2px solid #3b82f6; outline-offset: -1px; }
        .selector-arrow { position: absolute; right: 0.75rem; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%); pointer-events: none; color: #475569; }
        .dropdown { position: absolute; top: 100%; left: 0; right: 0; margin-top: 0.25rem; background: white; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 0.5rem; max-height: 20rem; overflow-y: auto; box-shadow: 0 10px 15px -3px rgb(0 0 0 / .1); z-index: 50; display: none; }
        .dropdown.open { display: block; }
        .opt { padding: 0.75rem; cursor: pointer; border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9; }
        .opt:hover { background: #eff6ff; }
        .opt:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
        .opt.selected { background: #dbeafe; font-weight: 600; }
        .opt.base-team { font-weight: 700; color: #1e40af; }
        .opt.subteam { padding-left: 2rem; color: #475569; }
        .opt.hidden { display: none; }

        /* Upcoming tournament days */
        .days-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.75rem; }
        .day-card { background: white; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 0.5rem; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgb(0 0 0 / .1); border-left: 4px solid #93c5fd; }
        .day-card.published { border-left-color: #1d4ed8; }
        .day-card.today { border-left-color: #16a34a; background: #f0fdf4; }
        .day-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 0.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
        .day-date { font-weight: 700; color: #1e293b; }
        .day-type { font-weight: 600; color: #1d4ed8; }
        .day-loc { font-size: 0.875rem; color: #475569; }
        .day-series { font-size: 0.8125rem; color: #475569; margin-top: 0.25rem; }
        .badge { display: inline-block; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 600; padding: 0.125rem 0.5rem; border-radius: 999px; margin-top: 0.5rem; }
        .badge.ok { background: #dbeafe; color: #1e40af; }
        .badge.wait { background: #f1f5f9; color: #64748b; }
        .badge.today { background: #dcfce7; color: #166534; }

        /* Team schedule */
        .section { margin-bottom: 2rem; }
        .section-head { background: #1e40af; color: white; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; border-radius: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
        .section-head .d { font-size: 1.125rem; font-weight: 700; }
        .section-head .m { font-size: 0.875rem; color: #dbeafe; }
        .pending { background: white; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 0.5rem; color: #475569; text-align: center; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgb(0 0 0 / .1); }
        .games-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; }
        .game-card { background: white; padding: 1.25rem; border-radius: 0.5rem; box-shadow: 0 10px 15px -3px rgb(0 0 0 / .1); border: 1px solid #2563eb; }
        .game-card-header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
        .game-time { font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; color: #1d4ed8; }
        .game-location { font-size: 0.875rem; color: #475569; text-align: right; }
        .game-field { font-size: 1.125rem; font-weight: 600; color: #334155; text-align: right; }
        .me { font-weight: 700; color: #1d4ed8; }
        .game-meta { font-size: 0.875rem; color: #475569; margin-top: 0.75rem; padding-top: 0.75rem; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; }
        .field-map { margin-top: 1rem; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; }
        .field-map img { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }
        .break-card { background: white; padding: 0.75rem; border-radius: 0.5rem; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgb(0 0 0 / .1); text-align: center; }
        .break-label { font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 600; color: #1e40af; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.025em; }
        .break-duration { font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; color: #1d4ed8; }

        .empty-state { text-align: center; color: #64748b; margin-top: 2rem; font-size: 1.125rem; }
        .muted-link { display: block; text-align: center; margin-top: 1rem; color: #1d4ed8; font-size: 0.875rem; }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container">
        <header>
            <h1><a href="/">Talviliiga<% if (season) { %> <%= season %><% } %></a></h1>
        </header>

        <main>
            <% if (!hasData) { %>
                <p class="empty-state">Otteluohjelmaa ei saatu haettua. Yritä hetken päästä uudelleen.</p>
            <% } else { %>
                <label class="selector-label" for="teamSearch">Valitse joukkue:</label>
                <div class="selector-wrap">
                    <input type="text" id="teamSearch" class="selector-input" placeholder="-- Kaikki joukkueet --" autocomplete="off" value="<%= selectedTeam || '' %>">
                    <span class="selector-arrow" aria-hidden="true">▼</span>
                    <div id="teamDropdown" class="dropdown" role="listbox">
                        <div class="opt" data-value="">-- Kaikki joukkueet --</div>
                        <% baseTeams.forEach(bt => { %>
                            <div class="opt base-team" data-value="base-team:<%= bt.name %>" data-fullname="<%= bt.name %>" data-search="<%= bt.name.toLowerCase() %>">● <%= bt.name %></div>
                            <% bt.subteams.forEach(sub => { const suffix = sub.substring(bt.name.length).trim(); %>
                                <div class="opt subteam <%= selectedTeam === sub ? 'selected' : '' %>" data-value="<%= sub %>" data-fullname="<%= sub %>" data-search="<%= sub.toLowerCase() %>"><%= bt.name %> - <%= suffix %></div>
                            <% }); %>
                        <% }); %>
                        <% individualTeams.forEach(team => { %>
                            <div class="opt <%= selectedTeam === team ? 'selected' : '' %>" data-value="<%= team %>" data-fullname="<%= team %>" data-search="<%= team.toLowerCase() %>"><%= team %></div>
                        <% }); %>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <% if (typeof notFound !== 'undefined' && notFound) { %>
                    <p class="empty-state">Joukkuetta "<%= notFound %>" ei löytynyt.</p>
                <% } else if (selectedTeam) { %>
                    <h2>
                        <% if (teamParent) { %>
                            <a href="/base-team/<%= encodeURIComponent(teamParent.name) %>"><%= teamParent.name %></a> / <%= teamParent.suffix %>
                        <% } else { %>
                            <%= selectedTeam %>
                        <% } %>
                    </h2>
                    <p class="subtitle"><%= teamSeries.length ? teamSeries.join(', ') : 'Sarjaa ei löytynyt ilmoittautuneista' %></p>

                    <% if (sections.length === 0) { %>
                        <p class="empty-state">Ei pelejä tänään eikä seuraavana turnauspäivänä. <a href="/">Tulevat turnauspäivät etusivulla</a>.</p>
                    <% } %>
                    <% sections.forEach((sec, si) => { %>
                        <div class="section">
                            <div class="section-head">
                                <div class="d"><%= sec.dateLabel %><% if (sec.firstTime) { %> · <%= sec.firstTime %><% if (sec.lastEnd) { %>–<%= sec.lastEnd %><% } %><% } %></div>
                                <div class="m"><%= sec.location %> · <%= sec.gameType %><% if (sec.organizer) { %> · <%= sec.organizer %><% } %><% if (sec.kiosk) { %> · Kioski: <%= sec.kiosk %><% } %></div>
                            </div>
                            <% if (sec.games.length === 0) { %>
                                <div class="pending">
                                    <% if (sec.published) { %>Ei pelejä tälle joukkueelle tänä päivänä.<% } else { %>Otteluohjelma julkaistaan myöhemmin.<% } %>
                                </div>
                            <% } else { %>
                                <div class="games-list">
                                    <% sec.games.forEach((game, gi) => { %>
                                        <% if (game.breakMin) { %>
                                            <div class="break-card">
                                                <div class="break-label">Tauko</div>
                                                <div class="break-duration"><%= game.breakMin %> min</div>
                                            </div>
                                        <% } %>
                                        <div class="game-card">
                                            <div class="game-card-header">
                                                <div class="game-time"><%= game.time %></div>
                                                <div>
                                                    <div class="game-location"><%= game.location %></div>
                                                    <div class="game-field"><%= game.field %></div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                            <div><span class="me"><%= selectedTeam %></span> vs <%= game.opponent %></div>
                                            <div class="game-meta">
                                                <strong>Pelimuoto:</strong> <%= game.gameType %><% if (game.gameDuration) { %> &middot; <strong>Kesto:</strong> <%= game.gameDuration %><% } %>
                                            </div>
                                            <% if (game.map) { const first = si === 0 && gi === 0; %>
                                                <div class="field-map" style="aspect-ratio:<%= game.map.width %>/<%= game.map.height %>;">
                                                    <img src="<%= game.map.src %>" alt="Kenttäkartta - <%= game.location %> <%= game.field %>"
                                                         width="<%= game.map.width %>" height="<%= game.map.height %>"
                                                         loading="<%= first ? 'eager' : 'lazy' %>" decoding="async">
                                                </div>
                                            <% } %>
                                        </div>
                                    <% }); %>
                                </div>
                            <% } %>
                        </div>
                    <% }); %>
                    <% if (includePast) { %>
                        <a class="muted-link" href="/team/<%= encodeURIComponent(selectedTeam) %>">Piilota menneet pelipäivät</a>
                    <% } else { %>
                        <a class="muted-link" href="/team/<%= encodeURIComponent(selectedTeam) %>?menneet">Näytä myös menneet pelipäivät</a>
                    <% } %>
                <% } else { %>
                    <h2>Tulevat turnauspäivät</h2>
                    <p class="subtitle">Valitse joukkue nähdäksesi sen pelit.</p>
                    <% if (upcomingDays.length === 0) { %>
                        <p class="empty-state">Ei tulevia turnauspäiviä.</p>
                    <% } %>
                    <div class="days-list">
                        <% upcomingDays.forEach(d => { %>
                            <div class="day-card <%= d.isToday ? 'today' : (d.gamesPublished ? 'published' : '') %>">
                                <div class="day-head">
                                    <span class="day-date"><%= d.dateLabel %></span>
                                    <span class="day-type"><%= d.organizer %> · <%= d.gameType %></span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="day-loc"><%= d.location %><% if (d.kiosk.length) { %> · Kioski: <%= d.kiosk.join(', ') %><% } %></div>
                                <div class="day-series"><%= d.seriesLabels.join(' · ') %></div>
                                <% if (d.isToday) { %>
                                    <span class="badge today">Tänään</span>
                                <% } else if (d.gamesPublished) { %>
                                    <span class="badge ok">Otteluohjelma julkaistu (<%= d.gamesPublished %> peliä)</span>
                                <% } else { %>
                                    <span class="badge wait">Otteluohjelma julkaistaan myöhemmin</span>
                                <% } %>
                            </div>
                        <% }); %>
                    </div>
                <% } %>

                <script>
                    const inp = document.getElementById('teamSearch');
                    const dd = document.getElementById('teamDropdown');
                    inp.addEventListener('click', () => { dd.classList.toggle('open'); inp.select(); });
                    inp.addEventListener('input', () => {
                        const q = inp.value.toLowerCase().trim();
                        dd.classList.add('open');
                        dd.querySelectorAll('.opt').forEach(o => {
                            const s = o.getAttribute('data-search') || '';
                            o.classList.toggle('hidden', q !== '' && !s.includes(q));
                        });
                    });
                    dd.addEventListener('click', e => {
                        const o = e.target.closest('.opt');
                        if (!o) return;
                        const val = o.getAttribute('data-value');
                        dd.classList.remove('open');
                        if (!val) window.location.href = '/';
                        else if (val.startsWith('base-team:')) window.location.href = '/base-team/' + encodeURIComponent(val.slice(10));
                        else window.location.href = '/team/' + encodeURIComponent(val);
                    });
                    document.addEventListener('click', e => {
                        if (!inp.contains(e.target) && !dd.contains(e.target)) dd.classList.remove('open');
                    });
                </script>
            <% } %>
        </main>
    </div>

    <footer>
        <p>Epävirallinen työkalu Talviliigan otteluohjelman selaamiseen. Lähteet: <a href="<%= sheetUrl %>" rel="noopener">Tervarit Juniorit</a> ja <a href="<%= olsUrl %>" rel="noopener">OLS</a>.</p>
        <p><% if (lastUpdated) { %>Päivitetty <%= new Date(lastUpdated).toLocaleString('fi-FI', { timeZone: 'Europe/Helsinki' }) %>. <% } %>Palaute: <a href="mailto:leohoitaa@gmail.com">leohoitaa@gmail.com</a></p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
